+## Overview
+
+Total revenue was $7,154.44 across 30 orders placed between May 2 and May 21, 2026. The average order was worth $238.48, while the median order value was $204.95. Sales spanned four regions and four products.
+
+## Top Products
+
+Gadget led all products with $2,392.00 in revenue from just 16 units sold, making it the strongest earner per unit. Widget followed at $2,118.94 on 106 units. Doohickey brought in $1,513.00, and Sprocket earned $1,130.50 despite moving the most units at 238.
+
+## Regional Performance
+
+North generated the most revenue at $2,176.35, followed by East at $1,830.79 and South at $1,732.48. West trailed the group at $1,414.82, about 35% below North.
+
+## Recommendations
+
+- Expand Gadget stock and promotion in North, where high-value orders concentrate.
+- Review West pricing and marketing, since it lags every other region in revenue.
+- Bundle Sprocket with higher-priced items to lift its low per-unit revenue.
